[0.005, "o", "\r\n\n\u001b[K Demo 1: traffic spike and autoscaling\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K What you're about to see: the 'knative-demo-app' Knative Service sitting\r\n\u001b[K idle at 0 replicas, a burst of 15 concurrent requests\r\n\u001b[K hitting it, the activator triggering scale-out on demand (watch\r\n\u001b[K the k9s pane above), and it scaling back down to 0 once the\r\n\u001b[K load stops -- no HPA, no external metrics, no manual scaling.\r\n\u001b[K============================================================\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### resetting to a single revision at 100% traffic (clean baseline)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[Kservice.serving.knative.dev/knative-demo-app patched (no change)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### waiting for a clean idle baseline (scale-to-zero, up to ~30s)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[Kpods running: 0\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### starting port-forward to kourier-internal\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[19;96H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K What you're about to see: the 'knative-demo-app' Knative Service sitting\r\n\u001b[K idle at 0 replicas, a burst of 15 concurrent requests\r\n\u001b[K hitting it, the activator triggering scale-out on demand (watch\r\n\u001b[K the k9s pane above), and it scaling back down to 0 once the\r\n\u001b[K load stops -- no HPA, no external metrics, no manual scaling.\r\n\u001b[K============================================================\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### resetting to a single revision at 100% traffic (clean baseline)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[Kservice.serving.knative.dev/knative-demo-app patched (no change)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### waiting for a clean idle baseline (scale-to-zero, up to ~30s)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[Kpods running: 0\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K### starting port-forward to kourier-internal\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[19;96H"]
[5.040, "o", "\r\n\n\u001b[K hitting it, the activator triggering scale-out on demand (watch\r\n\u001b[K the k9s pane above), and it scaling back down to 0 once the\r\n\u001b[K load stops -- no HPA, no external metrics, no manual scaling.\r\n\u001b[K================================================="]
